        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 451332, Greeley Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Greeley Arched Sandcast Handleset features a full escutcheon plate for a stately effect. This rustic Greeley Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is a great choice for historic homes thanks to its arched design and old world finish choices. The Greeley Handleset is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Sandcast Bronze Greeley Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Greeley Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-450332-specifications.pdf?v=1704262355\"><b>Emtek 451332 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-C-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
